<title>JAPAN: Megane Top plans share split.</title>
<headline>Megane Top plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Megane Top Corp said on Wednesday it planned a 1.5-for-1 share split on October 20, for shareholders as of August 29.  </p>
<p>The company's total issued shares will increase to 6.83 million from 4.55 million shares as a result of the share split, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Shares in the glasses retailer were registered on the over-the-counter market on June 3.</p>
